6. Build a dict mapping ks0 value -> E(ks0) (they should be consistent since AES is deterministic).
7. For each encryption i, for block1 (ks1_i) and block2 (ks2_i), if the ks value is in the dict, decrypt: plaintext_block = cipher_block XOR E(ks).
